  "content": "\"DEF CON, Black Hat, and so many other things we now take for granted in this community exist because Jeff had the vision, stubbornness, and mischief to make them happen,\" says Daniel Cuthbert, a member of the Black Hat Review Board and global head of security research at Banco Santander. \"He helped create the rooms, the culture, and the weird little ecosystem where hackers could find each other, argue, learn, build, and occasionally cause beautiful chaos.\"",
